'''Bakoo''' (ユメミちゃん ''Yumemi-chan'') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Bombergirl (Deadly)|Deeply Dreaming]]. She was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Bakoo
|image = E 431.png
|first appearance = [[Bombergirl (Deadly)|Deeply Dreaming]]<br>
'''ZL''': [[The Farthest Point|Sub-chapter 8 - The Farthest Point]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Bakoo has somewhat high damage, a fast attack rate and ridiculously long reach. While she stands at 180 range, she has Long Distance which can reach up to 1,850 range, allowing her to effectively outrange every Cat in the game by at least 600 range. Along with that, she has 100% chance to freeze all units in her massive attack area for 5 seconds. Her weaknesses include her unusually low standing range, low health and very high knockback count, key to unit selection when building around her stages.

As Bakoo is one of the weakest [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]] in terms of stats, she has a low money drop by their standards, and most of her later appearances have multiple Bakoos spawn throughout the battle, including [[Revenge of the Dreamer (Merciless)|Revenge of the Dreamer]], [[Heavenly Tower]] [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 45|Floor 45]], [[Infernal Tower]] [[Infernal Tower/Floor 45|Floor 45]], [[The Farthest Point]], and her [[Otherworld Colosseum]] appearances.

